START hilow_game: On a cool, rainy, fall evening my daughter and I decided to play a guessing game
instead of going on our weekly walk around the block. The game is simple, I think of a number between 
1-10 and we guess until the correct number is stated.

    
    
# Establish the number the player is trying to guess: 7
Guess a number between 1-10: 3 
no, too low!

Guess a higher number: 8
Too High!

Guess another number: 5
Too low!

Guess another number: 7
Yes!!
    

   .

END hilow_game


